  "text": "Home - Metropolitan Veterinary Associates\nSkip to content\nVeterinarians\nCareers\nInternship/Residency\nExternships\nMVA Blood Bank\nReferences\nFAQ\nBlog\nContact Us\nServices\nER & Urgent Care\nSpecialties\nPrimary Care\nDog Grooming\nDog and Cat Boarding\nDog Playcare\nSpecialties\nAcupuncture\nAnesthesia\nBehavioral Medicine\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry\nDermatology\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Boarding\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nPet Travel & Health Certificates\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nReproduction\nSurgery\nOur Doctors\nMetropolitan Veterinary Associates\nMetropolitan Veterinary Urgent Care and Specialty\nHickory Veterinary and Specialty\nHickory Veterinary Primary Care\nPet Parents\nMake an Appointment\nPrescription Refill Request\nPay Online\nPatient Forms\nCommunity Outreach\nPet Loss Support\nPaws of Promise\nBarbara Barrett Fund\nLocations\nMetropolitan Veterinary Associates\nMetropolitan Veterinary Urgent Care and Specialty\nHickory Veterinary and Specialty\nHickory Veterinary Primary Care\nHickory Pet Inn\nOpen mobile menu\nClose mobile menu\nComprehensive Veterinary Care\nin Greater Philadelphia\nMake an Appointment\nFind a Location\nFive locations. One network. Complete care for every stage of your pet’s life — from 24/7 emergency and specialty medicine to primary care, urgent care, boarding, and playcare across Montgomery County, the Main Line, and Greater Philadelphia. Whether your pet needs a routine wellness visit, same-day urgent care, emergency treatment at 2am, or a safe place to stay while you travel — the MVA Family of Hospitals has you covered.\nWhy the MVA Family of Hospitals?\nSpecialty Vet Care\nThe MVA Family of Hospitals is a premier specialty and emergency care network in our region, with hospitals serving pets, their owners, and referring veterinarians.\n24/7 Pet Care\nEmergency or urgent veterinary care available when you least expect to need it. Ready for you when your pet needs us.\nMore than Medical\nFrom boarding to play care, our pet Inn provides safe, trusted and loving care when you can’t be with your pet.\nExpert Care\nWe provide unsurpassed veterinary care to improve and enhance the quality of life for our pet patients.\nExcellent service and genuine commitment to the care of every animal. The team’s sense of urgency and kindness during such a stressful time meant so much to me.\nMegan P.\nExemplary from start to finish. Awesome reception staff, vet techs, and doctors. Caring, concerned, thorough, and super professional and knowledgeable.\nCarolyn F.\nSo lucky to have this resource nearby! Prompt, efficient scheduling. ALL staff was knowledgeable, compassionate, and great communicators.\nDeb R.\nFrom the facility to the people, the animal hospital had my confidence right away. Very professional and right away I felt my cat was in great care.\nDonald C.\nThe staff was so warm, and our vet was especially kind, which put us at ease. Thank you so much, Metro team!!\nElizabeth C.\nWe feel very fortunate to have this facility close to our home. They are always there when we have needed them. I can’t recommend them enough.\nJoanne D.\nProviding comprehensive veterinary care for pets across Greater Philadelphia, including Plymouth Meeting, Ambler, Wayne, Norristown,  and surrounding Pennsylvania communities.\n24/7 Emergency, Specialty, Primary Care, Boarding, and Playcare for Comprehensive Care for Every Stage of Your Pet’s Life.\nSpecialty Services\nPrimary Care\nBoarding & Playcare\nOur Locations\nMetropolitan Veterinary Associates (MVA)\nEmergency, Critical Care, and Specialty\n2626 Van Buren Avenue, Norristown, PA 19403\nP\n610-666-1050\nE\ninfo@metro-vet.com\nMetro Vet Urgent Care & Specialty (MVUCS)\nSpecialty Surgery Center and Urgent Care\n997 Old Eagle School Rd, Ste 200, Wayne, PA 19087\nP\n610-616-8827\nE\ninfo@metro-vet.com\nHickory Veterinary & Specialty Hospital (HVSH)\nEmergency & Critical Care, Specialty, and Cat & Dog Primary Care\n2303 Hickory Road, Plymouth Meeting, PA 19462\nP\n610-828-3054\nE\ninfo@hickoryvet.com\nHickory Pet Inn (HPI)\nCat and Dog Boarding and Playcare\n2303 Hickory Road, Plymouth Meeting, PA 19462\nP\n610-825-8895\nE\nhpi@hickoryvet.com\nHickory Veterinary Primary Care (HVPC)\nCat and Dog Primary Care\n500 Willow Avenue, Ambler, PA 19002\nP\n610-215-7717\nE\ninfo@hickoryvetambler.com\nMeet Our Team of 80+ Doctors\nOur Doctors\nMeet the Humans Your Pet Loves\nSit. Stay. Subscribe.\nFor pet care tips and updates, minus the fluff.\nIn An Emergency\nPhone MVA:\n610-666-1050\nPhone Hickory:\n610-839-8538\nPhone MVUCS:\n610-616-8827\nResources\nMake an Appointment\nPrescription Refill Request\nPay Online\nPatient Forms\nSubmit a Testimonial\nLocation Quick Links\nMetropolitan Veterinary Associates\nMetro Vet Urgent Care and Specialty\nHickory Veterinary and Specialty Hospital\nHickory Veterinary Primary Care\nHickory Pet Inn\nMetropolitan Veterinary Associates\nPrivacy Policy",
